        <p class="path-card__row path-card__row--watch">{item.watch}</p>
      </div>
    ))}
  </div>

  <div class="highlight-box highlight-box--teal">
    <p>
      <strong>The ownership path:</strong> an academy or studio with your own batches and fixed monthly fees, or online coaching with your own client list, lets you control price and add clients or assistant coaches. A teaching post cannot do that, which is why it is rated lower.
    </p>
  </div>

  <h2 id="pay">Pay, with the source and the catch</h2>

  <p>
    There is no clean public median for physical education pay. These are the figures we could source, with their limits. Treat them as a way to compare routes, not a promise.
  </p>

  <div class="table-wrap">
    <table class="paths-table">
