        </div>
      </div>
    ))}
  </div>

  <div class="honest-take">
    <p class="honest-take__label">Honest take</p>
    <p>
      No public source we found breaks out how many physical education teacher posts are vacant, so be careful with any page that claims a shortage. Overall school teacher vacancies are large, about 9.8 lakh of 69.9 lakh sanctioned posts in one 2025 analysis, but that is for all subjects and the estimates are disputed. Plan for steady demand, not a guaranteed post.
    </p>
  </div>

  <h2 id="govt">The government-jobs lens: honest opportunity cost</h2>

  <p>
    A government physical education post gives security, a clear pay scale and a good schedule. It also costs years of preparation across attempts, and the study for one state's exam is less marketable than coaching experience or a data skill if you do not get the post.
  </p>

  <div class="comparison-grid">
    <div class="compare-card compare-card--teal">
      <div class="compare-card__label">What a government post gives</div>
      <ul>
        <li>Steady pay, a pension or benefits as the rules of that service allow, and a stable schedule.</li>
        <li>Time outside school hours, where the service rules allow side work.</li>
        <li>A role in schools, which suits people who like teaching children.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="compare-card compare-card--gold">
      <div class="compare-card__label">What it costs and limits</div>
      <ul>
        <li>Fixed pay bands. Growth is by promotion, not by taking on more clients.</li>
        <li>Preparation across attempts, and income given up while you wait for a notice.</li>
        <li>Transfers, and service rules that can limit paid outside work. Verify the rules for your post.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p>
    This does not mean wealth is impossible in government service. Saving and investing a fixed salary builds real wealth. The point is that the job itself gives little income leverage, so any ownership layer has to be built outside it, within the rules.
  </p>

  <h3>Sports quota: what it is and is not</h3>

  <p>
    Several states reserve a share of posts for sportspersons. It rewards sporting achievement, not the degree.
  </p>

  <div class="table-wrap">
    <table class="paths-table">
