  <div class="highlight-box highlight-box--teal">
    <p>
      <strong>Keep the books honest.</strong> Track what you earn after ground rent, equipment, insurance and your own time. Treat a large payment as partly spoken for. Check GST and Udyam rules on the official portals when you start earning, since thresholds change. Put child safety first: first aid, clear rules and parent contact.
    </p>
  </div>

  <h2 id="ai">What AI changes in physical education, and what it barely touches</h2>

