  <p>
    The risk to in-person teaching is low. The pressure is on generic adult workout plans, and on school budgets. For a coach, the opportunity is leverage: one person with video tools can review more sessions, send clearer feedback and serve more clients, though no fixed multiplier is guaranteed.
  </p>

  <div class="gates-block">
