  <p>
    This stack, not the degree certificate, is your high-value skill portfolio, and it is what moves a coach from a fixed salary toward high income opportunities and earlier financial freedom. Teaching also draws on communication, and English helps with parents, institutions and online clients. Networking with other coaches and school staff brings the first batches. Show your work early on one platform you can keep up.
  </p>

